title: DuFour Voices Disapproval
subtitle: While powerless, he still possesses significant sway over our bourgeois allies.
view-if: (president == "DuFour" and presidential_powers and marcher_in_government and dufour_angry >= 115 and dufour_angry_trigger) and chancellor != "Askew" and next_election_time - time > 3 and not in_marcher_majority and not in_left_front and time >= dufour_grr_time
priority: -1
