on-arrival: gold_relation -= 6; ddp_relation -= 3; lvp_relation -= 3; unionist_relation -= 3 if chancellor_party != "Unionist"; coalition_dissent += 1; dufour_grr_time = time + 6; dufour_grr_amount += 1
max-visits: 3

= DuFour Voices Disapproval

President DuFour has made his dissatisfaction with the <span style="color: #c00000;">Reformist</span> presence in government clear and would use his presidential powers to remove us by force—if he actually had them.

[? if dufour_grr_amount <= 2: However, DuFour still holds great sway over the bourgeois parties and, along with his influential inner circle, has pressured them to break with our government. ?][? if dufour_grr_amount > 2: DuFour has been sidelined lately, and his influence over the bourgeois parties have weakened. This is the last time we will hear of the old man. ?]